# Property 2: the fixture is already wounded; then cast Cure
# Light Wounds on the caster ('*' = Target Self), then save.
# The fixture holds only the created character; setup-human-priest-mage-wounded-seed4-gate.keys makes the state the old save held (bd inc-10v7f).
@include setup-human-priest-mage-wounded-seed4-gate.keys
@dump:hurt
@until "Select Spell" m
@choose "Cure Light Wounds"
@dump:clw-prompt
*
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:healed
ESC
@expect "System Menu"
b
@dump:saved
